--
-- Purpose: This is the top most level file that is dynamically generated by
--          LabVIEW FPGA code generation software. It is instantiated by the
--          target provided top level file. The window does the following:
--           - Instantiate rvi_foo : This contains the user diagram logic.
--           - Instantiate DCM/PLL : To generate user derived clocks.
--           - Instantiate CLIP modules.
--           - Connect rvi_foo with the DmaPort communication interface
--             that is instantiated in the target toplevel file.
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

